<title>HONG KONG: Concept Dev cut Magician stake by 7.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Concept Dev cut Magician stake by 7.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concept Developments Ltd had sold 26 million shares, representing 7.9 percent of Magician Industries (Holdings) Ltd issued share capital, on August 29 and 30, Magician told the stock exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>Concept Developments is owned by Kong Yick Ming, a director of Magician Industries.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details on Concept Developments' stake in Magician Industries.</p>
<p>Magician Industries makes plastic and metal general housewares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
